      "side": 1,
      "message": "Documentation? In our hour of triumph?\n\nThere will definitely need to be something linking these APIs to the Java APIs in the host, where:\n- host \u003d the Android app creating the VM\n- payload \u003d the native code running inside the VM.\n\nI think we\u0027ll end up with a README.md here and have it link to the host API javadoc and vice versa. But that\u0027ll be a little easier once they both exist.",
